{"parse": {"title": "谋杀始于清晨-02", "pageid": 110538, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%B0%8B%E6%9D%80%E5%A7%8B%E4%BA%8E%E6%B8%85%E6%99%A8-02\" title=\"谋杀始于清晨-02\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">谋杀始于清晨-02</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%B0%8B%E6%9D%80%E5%A7%8B%E4%BA%8E%E6%B8%85%E6%99%A8-04\" title=\"谋杀始于清晨-04\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">谋杀始于清晨</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">02</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E6.97.A0.E8.85.B0.E7.BA.BF.E8.AE.BE.E8.AE.A1\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"无腰线设计\">无腰线设计</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 无腰线设计</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">A Dress to Make</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_7_bg_huanchengdadao_zhou.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_7_bg_huanchengdadao_zhou\"><img alt=\"1_7_bg_huanchengdadao_zhou\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/Cg-1_7_bg_huanchengdadao_zhou.png/600px-Cg-1_7_bg_huanchengdadao_zhou.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/Cg-1_7_bg_huanchengdadao_zhou.png/900px-Cg-1_7_bg_huanchengdadao_zhou.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/Cg-1_7_bg_huanchengdadao_zhou.png/1200px-Cg-1_7_bg_huanchengdadao_zhou.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>闭上眼，短暂的巴黎之游依旧鲜活。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>回到鲁昂，玛丽安娜不愿再忤逆父亲，于是六年前她依照安排进入乌苏拉修女会学习。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>与人为善，弃绝纷争，这是教徒所应有的品质。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"514001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-514001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-514001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"514001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-514001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-514001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-514001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-514001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏珊娜：</div><div>你还可以选择一种“新”的生活方式。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>选择……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong\"><img alt=\"1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png/600px-Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png/900px-Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png/1200px-Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>原来已经这么厚了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛丽安娜捧着书册，低声感慨。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这是她从时尚杂志上小心裁剪制成的册子，厚重到早已不能随身携带。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>姑母没有食言，过去六年她不断给玛丽安娜寄来这些杂志，并以福音书的封面伪装。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她学着姑母，用教会的宣传册粘贴成封面，父亲从未发现她的“叛逆”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>……请赐予我面临困境时的勇气，让我的决定受您的指引。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>阿门。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她第一次将这本册子大方地放在桌上，接着走向选择的岔路口。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-sufubihaozhai.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"sufubihaozhai\"><img alt=\"sufubihaozhai\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/Cg-sufubihaozhai.png/600px-Cg-sufubihaozhai.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/Cg-sufubihaozhai.png/900px-Cg-sufubihaozhai.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/Cg-sufubihaozhai.png/1200px-Cg-sufubihaozhai.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-526701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-526701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-526701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃曼努埃尔：</div><div>荒谬！你还记得自己是石像鬼吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-526701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-526701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-526701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃曼努埃尔：</div><div>种族的血脉在你身上流淌，你就得时刻倚靠神的教诲让自己免于堕落。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-526701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-526701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-526701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃曼努埃尔：</div><div>你不仅不愿花时间钻研血脉天赋，现在还想脱离修道院的教导？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-526701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-526701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-526701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃曼努埃尔：</div><div>你想变成真正的恶魔吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>父亲的发鬓已经染白，但惯于主导所有的威严，并未随年龄减退。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛丽安娜握紧拳头，刻意忽略了胆怯，迎上父亲的怒气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>信心在于认识神与圣灵，只想着敬畏教堂和修道院才会走向毁灭。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>哪怕我去的是公立中学，但我的心里始终确信主的恩赐，就不会步入堕落。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>世俗教育也不会玷污我的血脉，新时代的理性能帮我更好地实践辨别善恶的天赋。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-526701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-526701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-526701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃曼努埃尔：</div><div>……不管你怎么狡辩，我都不会同意你去公立中学。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-526701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-526701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-526701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃曼努埃尔：</div><div>这个话题到此结束。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>父女俩毫不退让，僵局直到一位年迈的老者到来才得以被打破。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"520001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-520001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-520001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"520001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-520001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-520001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-520001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-520001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛德莱娜：</div><div>咳……经文上的教诲，不该用于争论攻击吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>奶奶！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-526701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-526701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-526701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃曼努埃尔：</div><div>母亲，您这时应该在午睡才是，怎么……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"520001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-520001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-520001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"520001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-520001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-520001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-520001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-520001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛德莱娜：</div><div>你们吵架的声音这么大，我怎么睡得好呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>对不起，奶奶……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>白发苍苍的老人摆了摆手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"520001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-520001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-520001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"520001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-520001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-520001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-520001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-520001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛德莱娜：</div><div>让玛丽去吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-526701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-526701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-526701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃曼努埃尔：</div><div>什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"520001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-520001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-520001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"520001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-520001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-520001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-520001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-520001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛德莱娜：</div><div>教会学校不断关停，现下早就难以获得纯净的教导了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"520001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-520001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-520001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"520001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-520001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-520001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-520001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-520001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛德莱娜：</div><div>但如果玛丽没有亲身得证，她绝不会相信吧？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"520001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-520001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-520001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"520001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-520001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-520001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-520001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-520001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛德莱娜：</div><div>她还这么小，等她长大自然懂得你现在的苦心，何必要在这里毁掉父女情谊呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>老人的言论缓和了厅室中剑拔弩张的气氛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"520001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-520001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-520001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"520001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-520001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-520001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-520001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-520001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛德莱娜：</div><div>倔脾气的玛丽妮特，你想好要去哪所中学了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>鲁昂女子中学！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"520001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-520001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-520001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"520001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-520001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-520001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-520001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-520001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛德莱娜：</div><div>好，那就这样做吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"520001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-520001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-520001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"520001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-520001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-520001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-520001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-520001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛德莱娜：</div><div>快回房祷告，刚才这番动静可不是神所乐意见的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>奶奶，谢谢您！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-526701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-526701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-526701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃曼努埃尔：</div><div>母亲，您不能在这件事上这么纵容她！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-526701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-526701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-526701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃曼努埃尔：</div><div>要是玛丽安娜将世俗的庸识误认为真道，那她就更学不会辨清善恶了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛丽安娜领会到祖母的好心，顺着她的意思，雀跃地转身回房。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>父亲痛心而无奈的抱怨轻巧地被挡在门外。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong\"><img alt=\"1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png/600px-Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png/900px-Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png/1200px-Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>画过圣号，念过祷文，玛丽安娜依言做完了祷告。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>接着，她兴冲冲地伏到书桌前，沾好墨水，一刻不停地开始书写。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>一定要告诉艾格尼丝这个好消息，她会为我高兴的。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-typerbg.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"typerbg\"><img alt=\"typerbg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/Cg-typerbg.png/600px-Cg-typerbg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/Cg-typerbg.png/900px-Cg-typerbg.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/Cg-typerbg.png/1200px-Cg-typerbg.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">信纸：</div><div><span style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">亲爱的艾格尼丝，我听闻你再次去到圣利济耶，调养身体。</span></span><br /><br /><span style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">虽然你从不抱怨，在疾病的苦难中，依旧祷念神的恩赐，接受自己作为教徒的磨难。</span></span><br /><br /><span style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">但我衷心为你祈愿，望圣母的慈爱降临于你，让你的心脏恢复得与常人无异。</span></span><br /><br /><span style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">你说，神的旨意已为我们安排了一切。我深信不疑，因为我已察觉在我选择的前方，是神在呼唤我。</span></span><br /><br /><span style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">还有祖母一如既往的宽容与爱，得以让我去到我应去的地方——</span></span><br /><br /><span style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">我可以去公立中学读书了！望我的喜悦能传达给你，为你减轻皮肉造成的困苦。</span></span><br /><br /><span style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">这是个好兆头，也许祖母还会支持我在读书之余到裁缝铺当学徒。</span></span><br /><br /><span style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">说不定一年内，我就能仿照波烈先生的设计，为你缝织一条不再束腰的直筒裙。</span></span><br /><br /><span style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">这将为我之后去到巴黎成为服装设计师提供莫大帮助……</span></span></div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong\"><img alt=\"1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png/600px-Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png/900px-Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png/1200px-Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“巴黎”化作圆月，牵引回忆的潮汐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她看向窗外，一如既往的阳光不仅照射在鲁昂，也正为巴黎添彩。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她闭上眼，试图回想起曾经走在香榭丽舍大街上的灼热。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_7_bg_huanchengdadao_zhou.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_7_bg_huanchengdadao_zhou\"><img alt=\"1_7_bg_huanchengdadao_zhou\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/Cg-1_7_bg_huanchengdadao_zhou.png/600px-Cg-1_7_bg_huanchengdadao_zhou.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/Cg-1_7_bg_huanchengdadao_zhou.png/900px-Cg-1_7_bg_huanchengdadao_zhou.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/Cg-1_7_bg_huanchengdadao_zhou.png/1200px-Cg-1_7_bg_huanchengdadao_zhou.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>也许就在这里，我会拥有一家自己的店铺。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>最好面向塞纳河畔，波纹落在裙摆上，比任何灯光都能让顾客光彩照人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>畅想顺遂且完美，毕竟在这里人们并不欢迎灾厄的光顾。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>说不定时间会顺应虔诚的祷告，最终将她领至理想的福地。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>直到——</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_7_bg_huanchengdadao_zhou.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_7_bg_huanchengdadao_zhou\"><img alt=\"1_7_bg_huanchengdadao_zhou\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/Cg-1_7_bg_huanchengdadao_zhou.png/600px-Cg-1_7_bg_huanchengdadao_zhou.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/Cg-1_7_bg_huanchengdadao_zhou.png/900px-Cg-1_7_bg_huanchengdadao_zhou.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/Cg-1_7_bg_huanchengdadao_zhou.png/1200px-Cg-1_7_bg_huanchengdadao_zhou.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312612.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-312612.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312612.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312612.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-312612.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312612.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-312612.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312612.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>嗬……！</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "谋杀始于清晨-02"}}